               ml/yr versus 43.2 (59.9) ml/yr for those below the median (P =
               0.044). CONCLUSIONS: Areas of normal-appearing lung are
               mechanically influenced by emphysematous areas and this lung at
               risk is associated with lung function decline. Clinical trial
               registered with www.clinicaltrials.gov (NCT00608764).",
